The 06:00 London trigger.

A Claude Routine pushes a new timestamp into this file every morning, and that push starts
.github/workflows/daily-run.yml. It exists because GitHub the scheduler is not punctual on
this repo — its cron has arrived four to five hours late every day — while a routine fires
within minutes of its time. The routine has git access to this repo but not the Actions API,
so a push is the trigger it can actually pull.

Nothing reads the contents; only the fact that the file changed matters.

